---
source: tests/edit_tests/rfc.rs
expression: value
---
$ govctl rfc new Original Title
Created RFC: gov/rfc/RFC-0001/rfc.toml
  Clauses dir: gov/rfc/RFC-0001/clauses
exit: 0

$ govctl rfc edit RFC-0001 title --set New Title
Set RFC-0001.title = New Title
exit: 0

$ govctl rfc list
┌──────────┬─────────┬────────┬───────┬───────────┐
│ RFC      ┆ Version ┆ Status ┆ Phase ┆ Title     │
╞══════════╪═════════╪════════╪═══════╪═══════════╡
│ RFC-0001 ┆ 0.1.0   ┆ draft  ┆ spec  ┆ New Title │
└──────────┴─────────┴────────┴───────┴───────────┘
exit: 0
